    <description>Case button Callback Not Reached: the agent called and didn't reach the customer. Svc_SalesCallback adds a try; before the last try the Case goes back to gqCaseSalesCallback1 (Omni routes it again), at the last try it closes as not reached and the manager gets a mail.</description>
